Design a 2-bit up/down counter that increments or decrements its count based on an input control signal. The counter resets to zero when the reset input is asserted. On each positive clock edge, if the up_down signal is high, the counter will increment; if it is low, the counter will decrement.
module top_module(input clk, rst, up_down,
     output reg [1:0] count);

