description:
Design a 3-to-8 line decoder. The module takes a 3-bit input and activates one of the eight output lines based on the binary value of the input, with each output corresponding to a unique input combination. When a valid input is presented (from 000 to 111), the corresponding output line is set to HIGH, while all others are LOW. If an undefined input is received, all outputs are set to HIGH, indicating an error state.
module top_module(
  input [2:0] a,
  output reg [7:0] out
);

code:
module top_module(
  input [2:0] a,
  output reg [7:0] out
);always @(*)
  begin
    case(a)
      3'b000: out = 8'b00000001;
      3'b001: out = 8'b00000010;
      3'b010: out = 8'b00000100;
      3'b011: out = 8'b00001000;
      3'b100: out = 8'b00010000;
      3'b101: out = 8'b00100000;
      3'b110: out = 8'b01000000;
      3'b111: out = 8'b10000000;
      default: out = 8'b11111111;
    endcase
  end

